        {
          "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#operations-evidence-0846"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#nginx-mime-patch"
        }
      ],
      "schema:description": "Responsible role: VM100 operator, unassigned. Prerequisite: an available authorized VM100 management transport. Preserve the live root and existing routes; add only the prepared exact location, validate nginx configuration, reload and verify direct/public application/ld+json plus payload hash and existing home/wiki/learn checks. On failure restore the saved live config and revalidate. The existing user authorization is not revoked; missing transport is not a request to approve the same work again.",
      "mh:authority": "SECONDARY_AI_HANDOFF_TASK",
      "mh:status": "OPEN_MISSING_MANAGEMENT_TRANSPORT"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#review-public-client-access",
      "@type": "schema:Action",
      "schema:name": "Resolve Cloudflare browser-signature rejection for public Foundation data",
      "schema:actionStatus": {
        "@id": "schema:PotentialActionStatus"
      },
      "schema:object": [
        {
          "@id": "https://metahumotonic.com/foundation/graph.jsonld"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://metahumotonic.com/foundation/usl.json"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://metahumotonic.com/foundation/manifest.json"
        }
      ],
      "schema:subjectOf": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#evidence"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#operations-evidence-0846"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:metahumotonic:handoff:foundation:2026-09-29#cloudflare-bic-rule"
        }
      ],
      "schema:description": "Responsible role: public edge operator, unassigned. At 08:41-08:46 UTC all three public Foundation data paths returned 403 to default Python urllib; GET bodies reported Cloudflare error 1010. Direct origin GET/HEAD returned 200. Official documentation identifies browser-signature rejection and recommends inspecting Browser Integrity Check. This is a diagnosis from responses and documentation, not a live account-rule readback. A narrow GET/HEAD rule draft is ready; inspect the matching event and current configuration rules before applying. Acceptance: default machine clients receive 200 with expected media types and unchanged payloads; record actual applied rule and readback. No edge policy write has occurred.",
      "mh:authority": "SECONDARY_AI_HANDOFF_TASK",
      "mh:status": "OPEN_DIAGNOSED_MISSING_EDGE_CONNECTION"
    },
